            "value": "打开网页并打开App需要先终止当前App，要继续吗？若App支持，你也可以在当前App内打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您確定要開啟網頁並啟動App嗎？這樣做將停止此應用程式。您可以嘗試在目前應用程式中開啟它（如果App支援通用連結）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "lc.guestTweak.restartToInstall": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please restart LiveContainer to install apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请重启LiveContainer以安装App。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請重新啟動LiveContainer 來安裝App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "lc.helpView.text1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setup JITLess mode in settings to use LiveContainer without JIT.\n\n**Check JITLess Diagnose page in settings if you have trouble enabling JITLess mode.**\n\nPress plus button to install apps.\n\nHolding app banner for app-specific settings, fixes and adding apps to home screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在设置中配置免JIT模式来使得LiveContainer无需JIT权限即可使用。\n\n**如果配置免JIT模式时遇到问题，请查看免JIT模式诊断页面。**\n\n点击加号按钮来安装App。\n\n长按App可查看App设置，修复App问题，以及将App添加到主屏幕。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在設定中設定免JIT模式來使得LiveContainer無需JIT即可使用。\n\n**如果在設定免JIT模式時遇到問題，請查看免JIT模式診斷頁面。 **\n\n點選加號按鈕來安裝App。\n\n長按App可以查看App設置、修復App問題、和將App添加至主畫面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "lc.helpView.text2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Check [LiveContainer FAQ](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues/265) for common issues.**\n                         \nIf you encounter a bug or compatibility issue please submit on [GitHub issues](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**遇到问题时请先查看[LiveContainer常见问题（英语）](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues/265)。**\n                         \n如果你遇到Bug或者App兼容性问题，请到[GitHub issues](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues)提交。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "                         **遇到問題時請先查看[LiveContainer常見問題（英文）](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues/265)。 **\n                         \n如果您遇到Bug或是App相容性問題，請至[GitHub issues](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues)提交錯誤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
